 ## Project Objective

 The primary objective of this project is to convert raw sales information into an interactive management dashboard that provides a clear view of **sales performance, product contribution, salesperson performance, monthly trends, and sales distribution**.

 This project demonstrates practical skills in **data analysis, dashboard development, business intelligence, data visualization, and extracting actionable insights from structured sales data**.
